; FreeNova Advertisement Rotator Configuration
; File: addons/amxmodx/configs/freenova/ads.ini
; Loaded by freenova_ads.amxx at map start. Reload live from server console
; (ADMIN_RCON): fnads_reload  -  in chat: /adsreload
;
; Format - one ad per line:
;   <type> | <text>
;   type = chat | hud | both   (case-insensitive; the text may contain '|')
;
; Rules:
;   - Blank lines and lines starting with ';' or '#' are ignored.
;   - Chat ads: color codes work (^1 grey, ^2 green, ^3 red, ^4 team color).
;     The ^4[FreeNova]^1 tag is prepended unless fnads_tag 0.
;   - HUD ads: one color for the whole message (fnads_color).
;     Line breaks: use ^n or \n. Do NOT use ^1-^4 in HUD ads - those are
;     chat-line codes, the HUD takes its color from fnads_color.
;   - \n typed in a chat ad becomes a space (chat cannot wrap lines).
;   - Keep chat ads at ~180 characters or less; longer text is truncated by
;     the engine (the plugin logs a warning when loading such a line).
;
; Cvars (defaults):
;   fnads_enabled     1     0 pauses rotation (the timer keeps running)
;   fnads_interval    90    seconds between ads (min 10; 0 stops until reload)
;   fnads_start_delay 30    seconds after map cfg before the first ad
;   fnads_channel     2     HUD channel - 1 or 2 only (3 is freenova_hud)
;   fnads_x           -1.0  HUD x (-1.0 = centered)
;   fnads_y           0.72  HUD y - avoid 0.22 (ReGameDLL MVP text) and
;                           0.20 (imessage) / 0.18 (freenova_hud)
;   fnads_hold        7.0   HUD hold time in seconds
;   fnads_color       54 222 171   "RRR GGG BBB", Eagle teal #36DEAB
;   fnads_random      0     1 = random order, never twice the same ad in a row
;   fnads_tag         1     prepend ^4[FreeNova]^1 to chat ads
;
; Coexistence (keep until cutover - this plugin never disables them):
;   scrollmsg (HUD ch2 @ y0.90, 600s; re-renders every 0.3s so it wins any
;   overlap), imessage (auto channel, y0.20, 180s), freenova_hud (ch3),
;   mapchooser / nextmap / timeleft.
; No vault involved: rotation state is in-memory, freenova_bp is never
; touched, no menabp_* calls are made.

